ave the world, or will your decisions lead to its downfall? <br>Step into the role of a god and redefine the fate of existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425720/extras/16cf8b47cf4145637585a3936119632b.avif?t=1738591268\" width=200 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425720/extras/ec18aee623b4351859ffa04524b4655d.avif?t=1738591268\" width=400 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425720/extras/653fcec55439907409911351227a3fd7.avif?t=1738591268\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
